[h1]Speculative Markets - Better Politics Mod Compatibility[/h1]
Makes Speculative Markets' interest group features work with Better Politics Mod. No balance changes.

[list]
[*]The interest group panel shows the Goods section again. Better Politics Mod replaces that panel, so this patch adds our section to its version.
[*]Better Politics Mod's 13 new interest groups, from the Liberals to the Agrarian Populists, support and oppose goods like the vanilla groups.
[*]Better Politics Mod's economic ideologies take a view on the Monetary Standard, so parties and interest groups support or oppose Bimetallism, the Gold Standard and Fiat Money.
[/list]

[h2]Load order[/h2]
[list]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=2932134122]Better Politics Mod[/url]
[*][url=https://steamcommunity.com/sharedfiles/filedetails/?id=3831434383]Speculative Markets[/url]
[*]This patch
[/list]
Without Better Politics Mod, you don't need this patch. It is built for the stable Speculative Markets, not the Beta.

Compatible with Speculative Markets 1.2.1, Better Politics Mod 2.5 and Victoria 3 1.15. Patch version: 1.0.1.

For bug reports, include your versions, load order and error log.

[h2]Credits[/h2]
Better Politics Mod is made by its authors. This patch includes their interest group panel with the Speculative Markets Goods section added.
